rs</strong> is essential, with <strong>lighthearted dialogue</strong>, <strong>hilarious situations</strong>, <strong>and darker moments...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050680/extras/b72b21a4e24f30a762375e641d002860.avif?t=1762461908\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050680/extras_big/b72b21a4e24f30a762375e641d002860.webp?t=1762461908 width=1560 height=69 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050680/extras/b64b89f88a0c5f8760ed4016eef72970.poster.avif?t=1762461908\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050680/extras/b64b89f88a0c5f8760ed4016eef72970.webm?t=1762461908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050680/extras/b64b89f88a0c5f8760ed4016eef72970.mp4?t=1762461908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050680/extras/d66379b33dfebccec7a4aea04f535845.avif?t=1762461908\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050680/extras_big/d66379b33dfebccec7a4aea04f535845.webp?t=1762461908 width=1560 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles </strong>are a key part of the plot, a series of <strong>mysterious box-shaped riddles</strong> to solve. Then there's the <strong>Book of Cryptids, with several missing pages which the player must somehow complete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha